SUMMARY:Citizenship Education Circle - Toronto Reference Library
DESCRIPTION:Are you new to Canada as a Permanent Resident or a Convention Refugee? \nFree weekly sessions to prepare for the Citizenship test. \n\nLearn about the test’s content and structure\nGet support and tips from our Volunteer Mentors\nPractice with sample quizzes\n\nFor Permanent Residents and Convention Refugees. \nTo register\, contact Victor Gomes at VGomes@culutrelink.ca or (437) 288-3027. \nYou can also register directly at the Library’s service desk. \nFunded by Immigration\, Refugees and Citizenship Canada.
