SUMMARY:Monthly Creative & Wellness Art Studio
DESCRIPTION:The Newcomer Wellness Program Presents our Monthly Creative & Wellness Art Studio! Join us every third Thursday of the month from 4:15 PM – 5:45 PM at the CultureLink office (2340 Dundas Street West Suite 301\, Toronto\, ON) \nEnjoy a new art experience every month while building connections\, reducing stress\, and supporting your wellbeing in a welcoming\, newcomer-friendly space. \nThrough guided creative activities\, participants can express themselves\, explore emotions\, and take time to relax. No art experience needed! \nLight refreshment and art supplies will be provided. \nFor more information\, email Marina at msokolov@culturelink.ca. \nTo register: Click Here
URL:https://www.culturelink.ca/event/monthly-creative-and-wellness-art-studio/2026-11-19/
LOCATION:CultureLink\, 2340 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.culturelink.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Creative-Wellness-Art-Studio-Web-Icon.png
END:VEVENT
